\name{GausSKAT-package}
\alias{GausSKAT-package}
\docType{package}
\title{Data-Adaptive Weighted Gaussian-Kernel SKAT}
\description{
Implements a phenotype-independent, data-adaptive grid of weighted Gaussian
kernels, evaluates the kernels using the official \pkg{SKAT} package, and
combines the dependent component p-values using ACAT.
}
\details{
The current implementation supports continuous-trait null models. See
\code{\link{GausSKAT}} for the main testing function.
}
